\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Frozen Phase-II design. Strategy forcing and conformance gating are crossed under a common raw-attempt cap; realized costs and admitted population sizes can differ. The gate is a trace instrument with neutral validity, counterfactual conformance, and non-vacuity checks.}}{4}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:design}{{2}{4}{Frozen Phase-II design. Strategy forcing and conformance gating are crossed under a common raw-attempt cap; realized costs and admitted population sizes can differ. The gate is a trace instrument with neutral validity, counterfactual conformance, and non-vacuity checks}{figure.2}{}}
